{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0cb9aa9dc5a833d900d","chatId":"9e0c282221eb44eb83952ce2afe123e7","sessionId":null,"userId":98670,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4688,"promptTokens":1506,"completionTokens":108,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:39"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019261336945536913,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0cb9aa9dc5a833d900c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482379149,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0cb9aa9dc5a833d900c","chatId":"9e0c282221eb44eb83952ce2afe123e7","sessionId":null,"userId":98670,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小薇最近从中国来了德国当交换生。今天早上，阿飒，她的德国同班同学，邀请她去看一个电影，电影7点半开始。在欧洲，不像在中国，电影通常晚20到30分钟开始播放。小薇8点才到，不过阿飒什么也没说。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小薇最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 无感\nB) 反对\nC) 尴尬\nD) 气恼\nE) 紧张\nF) 开心\n\n## 问题 2\n小薇为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她以为她看电影迟到了\nB) 阿飒没有在她到达时做出反应\nC) 她对德国电影时间表感到陌生\nD) 小薇没有邀请阿飒观看电影","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019261336945536913,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0cb9aa9dc5a833d900d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482379146,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e2c1da38bce54dbea5d63907302693f5"}